# PRs no longer edit `## Unreleased`: they add changelog.d/ fragments (changelog.d/README.md),
# because GitHub's merge check ignores this driver. Union stays for local merges of older
# branches that still carry an Unreleased entry. Union keeps both sides. It has one cost: a branch
# forked before a roll no longer conflicts when it merges after one. See docs/RELEASE.md,
# 'Rolling Unreleased into a version'.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
